                        "review": "**STOP AND WAIT UNTIL PROBLEM IS RESOLVED**\n\nYou can not play unless you make an account for their website, you can't make an account right now for their website because of some internal issue.\n\nOriginal problem is resolved...however , after getting a free key from a dev who reached out I decided to give the game an official go on the servers. when I got a game finally outside of the games being pitch black, I was unable to find anything, was not able to harvest resources, there was nothing as to where to go except for a map, when using the map, they are huge squares and it takes forever to get to any place, I ran for ten minutes and just threw in the towl, after all that has happened since launch, I would HARD PASS ON THIS GAME!",
